      "registered_domain": "... WHERE site = :site AND host != :host AND host_match_ok = 1 AND expires_at > :now"
    },
    "note": "full_url input: all three; domain input: url_key is '' so only hostname and registered_domain. Every match is phishing. No match is never evidence of safety."
